tps://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/402e9cd71b1e926d381e0634c18f72cc?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-24T19:21:36.000Z"},{"id":"4u1yhl7du","title":"7 trending frontend technologies for 2024 -","url":"https://virtuslab.com/blog/trending-frontend-technologies/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/7-trending-frontend-technologies-for-2024---4u1yhl7du","summary":"Learn about the upcoming trends in frontend technologies for 2024, including micro frontends, Next.js, headless CMS, the 'Signals Approach' in Angular, AI-driven design, serverless computing, and styling in React. Stay ahead in the ever-evolving world of frontend development!","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/8a1283742473c6580397de93002a892a?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":49,"num_comments":1,"created_at":"2024-01-08T14:26:46.000Z"},{"id":"ryHQCygnW","title":"Reference Architecture: A roadmap to efficiency and scalability","url":"https://virtuslab.com/blog/reference-architecture-roadmap/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/reference-architecture-a-roadmap-to-efficiency-and-scalability-ryhqcygnw","summary":"Reference architecture is a roadmap to efficiency and scalability for companies. It provides a guideline for setting up tech and services, ensuring alignment with legal and organizational standards. Creating a reference architecture involves understanding the platform, identifying needed technologies, determining security requirements, and following an agile feedback loop. Cloud provider reference architectures can be helpful, but customization and evaluation are necessary for organizational fit.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/f447421d9287258a90e6270e6f30a004?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-04T17:52:15.000Z"},{"id":"jCjABfkmV","title":"What does data transformation enable analysts to accomplish?","url":"https://virtuslab.com/blog/data-transformation-enable-data-analysts/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-does-data-transformation-enable-analysts-to-accomplish--jcjabfkmv","summary":"Data transformation involves converting raw data into a structured format suitable for analysis. It enhances analytical processes by making data accessible and easy to interpret. Techniques like SQL, Python, and Scala are employed in data transformation.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/dc190d9bea27740b98a87a279983e05d?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-11-24T10:13:47.000Z"},{"id":"d4QY8HVlz","title":"What is Data Mesh? Redefining Data Platform Architecture -","url":"https://virtuslab.com/blog/what-is-data-mesh-redefining-data-platform-architecture/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-is-data-mesh-redefining-data-platform-architecture---d4qy8hvlz","summary":"Data Mesh was founded on four key principles that revolutionised data management. It focuses on decentralisation, domain-oriented teams, data-as-a-product, self-serve platform, and federated governance. Data Mesh offers an alternative for larger organisations, distributing data ownership and governance to maintain manageability.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/98033df47fd95d32b31b74c316688af5?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-27T09:31:38.000Z"},{"id":"rNIpdQQ6e","title":"What is the future of Java in today's enterprise? -","url":"https://virtuslab.com/blog/what-is-the-future-of-java-in-todays-enterprise/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/what-is-the-future-of-java-in-today-s-enterprise---rnipdqq6e","summary":"Java has been a key player in software development since 1999. Companies that have invested a lot in Java are worried because they don't know what will happen next. It will come as a relief to learn that today\u2019s Java has many advantages for the modern digital enterprise.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/0aa72c36c4cbebd4f770e0470236c934?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":4,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-09-08T10:30:20.000Z"},{"id":"p0WXwg09u","title":"Cloud security policies in GCP: How to set them up using Terraform -","url":"https://virtuslab.com/blog/set-up-cloud-security-policies-gcp-terraform/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/cloud-security-policies-in-gcp-how-to-set-them-up-using-terraform---p0wxwg09u","summary":"With the growing popularity of cloud services, robust cloud security policies are essential. These policies protect against unauthorised access, data breaches and cyber-attacks. This is where the Google Cloud Platform (GCP) steps in as a reliable ally. The outlined steps clarify how to automate the management of cloud security Policies.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3835e6e9949012cebc52f04be3382a39?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-08-23T09:35:52.000Z"},{"id":"v51S3wiuk","title":"How to set up a Bazel testing configuration in Scala & Java","url":"https://virtuslab.com/blog/bazel-testing-configuration-comprehensive-guide/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-set-up-a-bazel-testing-configuration-in-scala-java-v51s3wiuk","summary":"The comprehensive guide for Scala and Java Bazel Testing provides developers with a reliable approach to validate their code. We will explore advanced techniques like test filtering and parallelisation, which greatly enhance the efficiency of your test runs. In this article, we will delve into the key concepts of Bazel testing configurations.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/14ba0af13a2648b2cc0aee0fd3ca2475?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-06-29T16:43:38.000Z"},{"id":"NFyZ9DqaN","title":"How to mine Scala3 compiler metadata with TASTy files","url":"https://virtuslab.com/blog/mine-scala-3-compiler-metadata-tasty-files/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-mine-scala3-compiler-metadata-with-tasty-files-nfyz9dqan","summary":"Scala 3 lets us write compiler plugins that we can use, but they are difficult to use. Decompilers allow parsing binaries without the need for the original project\u2019s source code setup. The key is to utilise TASTy files, which are included in target jars alongside binaries uploaded to Maven Central.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c944b1815c5ba3eaeaf51dbf391c8253?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-06-28T15:46:45.000Z"},{"id":"a8U4hDHQB","title":"Cloud Migration: Take Your Business to the Next Level -","url":"https://virtuslab.com/blog/cloud-migration-benefits-challenges/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/cloud-migration-take-your-business-to-the-next-level---a8u4hdhqb","summary":"In this digital transformation era, cloud migration has become necessary for businesses of all sizes. 50% of surveyed businesses reported reduced operating costs after migrating to the cloud. 64% saw better disaster recovery and business continuity and 36% reported a more flexible and scalable computing power. We will review the basics, benefits, and challenges of cloud migration.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/7ebcb37f98f0eb37ffdc9f967fafdaf5?_a=AQADKdt","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-06-20T07:59:57.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["nubank","ardalis","simplethread","softbinator","8thlight"],"opposite_handles":["javascriptmastery","dailydevworld","on_leuwcq","nickchapsas","wds"],"similar":[{"id":"nubank","handle":"nubank","name":"Nubank","is_squad":false,"x":0.8583,"y":0.8042,"cluster_id":3,"posts_collected":96,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/1bf6405e324e4d64a70b333b1ee945c4","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":0.393434,"median_upvotes":0.